    "keepEnglishTerms": [
     "raw material",
     "product",
     "Pihu",
     "recycle"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "In Grade 3 we learnt that things are made of different materials. How are they made? Let us learn with Pihu how paper is made.\nPihu was painting in her drawing book while her mother read a newspaper. A picture on the front page said that if we recycle paper we can save trees.\nHer mother told her that paper is made from trees. Her drawing book, the newspaper, paper napkins and chart papers are all made from trees.\nPihu touched a pot that looked like paper but felt rough. It was made from recycled paper.\nShe asked if they could make such paper. They tried, making recycled paper at home.\nA raw material is what a thing is made from. A product is the finished thing."
    }
